OL,3,GNEWSACathedral's pilgrimage centre
OL,4,Acompleted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new centre which will welcome
OL,7,Fpilgrims and visitors to a cathedral's
OL,8,Fhistoric chapel has been completed.
OL,10,FDurham Cathedral's Cuthbert Centre for
OL,11,FPilgrimage and Prayer will provide a
OL,12,Fspace for gathering and prayer, as well
OL,13,Fas activities to support pilgrimages
OL,14,Facross the North East.
OL,16,FDurham Dean, the Very Revd Dr Philip
OL,17,FPlyming said the facility would help
OL,18,Fpeople "encounter the richness of
OL,19,Fpilgrimage and prayer".
